opinion-effect-attacked-name = Attacked
opinion-effect-attacked-desc = Still seething over the unprovoked attack. Memories of this violence are still fresh in my mind.

opinion-effect-healed-name = Healed wounds
opinion-effect-healed-desc = Grateful for the medical care provided.

# Conversation
# Эффекты настроения от диалогов
mood-effect-pleasant-conversation-name = Pleasant Conversation
mood-effect-pleasant-conversation-desc = That was a nice chat. I feel better after talking to them.

mood-effect-unpleasant-conversation-name = Unpleasant Conversation
mood-effect-unpleasant-conversation-desc = That conversation left a bad taste in my mouth. I wish we hadn't talked.

mood-effect-rude-conversation-name = Rude Conversation
mood-effect-rude-conversation-desc = How disrespectful! That conversation put me in a foul mood.

mood-effect-inspirational-conversation-name = Inspirational Conversation
mood-effect-inspirational-conversation-desc = Their words were truly inspiring. I feel motivated and uplifted.

mood-effect-depressing-conversation-name = Depressing Conversation
mood-effect-depressing-conversation-desc = That conversation was so bleak. I feel my spirits sinking.

mood-effect-funny-conversation-name = Funny Conversation
mood-effect-funny-conversation-desc = That was hilarious! I'm still chuckling from our chat.

# Эффекты мнения от диалогов
opinion-effect-polite-dialogue-name = Polite Dialogue
opinion-effect-polite-dialogue-desc = They spoke to me with courtesy and respect. I appreciate their manners.

opinion-effect-rude-dialogue-name = Rude Dialogue
opinion-effect-rude-dialogue-desc = They were needlessly rude during our conversation. I don't appreciate that tone.

opinion-effect-insulting-dialogue-name = Insulting Dialogue
opinion-effect-insulting-dialogue-desc = They insulted me directly. I won't forget those hurtful words.

opinion-effect-supportive-dialogue-name = Supportive Dialogue
opinion-effect-supportive-dialogue-desc = They offered genuine support and understanding. That meant a lot to me.

opinion-effect-manipulative-dialogue-name = Manipulative Dialogue
opinion-effect-manipulative-dialogue-desc = I can tell they were trying to manipulate me. I don't trust their motives.

opinion-effect-honest-dialogue-name = Honest Dialogue
opinion-effect-honest-dialogue-desc = They were completely honest with me, even when it was difficult. I respect that.

opinion-effect-lying-dialogue-name = Lying Dialogue
opinion-effect-lying-dialogue-desc = They lied to my face. I can't trust anything they say now.

opinion-effect-encouraging-dialogue-name = Encouraging Dialogue
opinion-effect-encouraging-dialogue-desc = Their encouragement gave me a real boost. I feel they believe in me.

opinion-effect-condescending-dialogue-name = Condescending Dialogue
opinion-effect-condescending-dialogue-desc = They talked down to me like I was a child. I don't appreciate being patronized.
